%N A399223 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} O(2*k-1)/(2*k-1)^2, where O(k) = A350669(k)/A350670(k) is the k-th odd harmonic number (or harmonic number of the second kind).
%H A399223 Chunli Li and Wenchang Chu, <a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/math12040589">Evaluating infinite series involving harmonic numbers by integration</a>, Mathematics, Vol. 12, No. 4 (2024), Article 589. See p. 7, eq. (16).
